# #99 item 6: interrogative operands are FULL expressions (parse_expression),
# and the #868 `when <N>` qualifier (Nth recorded assignment) is mirrored.
y is 4
print of (who is y + 1)
print of (what is y * 2)
x is 1
x is 2
x is 3
print of (what is x when 2)
print of (what is x when 1)
print of (prev of x when 3)
print of (what is x)
